        {
          "author": "becarpenter",
          "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
          "body": "So, do we allow derivative rights limitation for slide decks shown at meetings?",
          "createdAt": "2026-05-14T04:57:01Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-14T04:57:01Z"
        },
        {
          "author": "sayrer",
          "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
          "body": "Thanks for the snark-removal.",
          "createdAt": "2026-05-14T19:10:33Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-14T19:10:33Z"
        },
        {
          "author": "sayrer",
          "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
          "body": "> So, do we allow derivative rights limitation for slide decks shown at meetings?\r\n\r\nI think we want to say it's important to note that the specification under discussion has these IPR restrictions.  #2\r\n",
          "createdAt": "2026-05-14T19:17:52Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-14T19:52:53Z"
        },
        {
          "author": "becarpenter",
          "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
          "body": "Since we say \"or other complete specifications\" I think the slide deck case is already covered.",
          "createdAt": "2026-05-16T21:14:47Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-16T21:14:47Z"
        },
        {
          "author": "sayrer",
          "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
          "body": "Let's take it to #2. I am not a pain in this way, but other people are, so let's make sure it's covered well.",
          "createdAt": "2026-05-16T23:59:12Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-16T23:59:12Z"
        }
      ],
